  "details": "Even today there are still a lot of Users on slow internet connections, these Users often have a very bad experience browsing pages with a lot of pictures like the home page of the website with it taking up to 1 minute to load all the images for some of my friends.\n\nThis also translates to a bad experience in game when browsing the worlds list or friends list.\n\nBlurhash (https://blurha.sh/) is a nice way to replace the images while they are still loading, which should greatly improve the browsing experience of users on slow connections.",
